# Security headers for every page and asset (todo 706, audit 2026-11-10 M2).
# Cloudflare Workers static assets read this file from web/dist, where Vite
# copies everything in web/public.
#
# The CSP ships REPORT-ONLY first: it blocks nothing, and with no report
# endpoint a violation only shows in the browser console. Promote it to
# Content-Security-Policy once production shows no violations (todo 716 checks
# the live headers after deploy).
#
# frame-ancestors keeps the API origin: the Wagtail CMS on
# https://api.houseplant-md.com frames /blog/preview. Do not add
# X-Frame-Options, which cannot allow that origin and would break the preview.
# Referrer-Policy stays strict-origin-when-cross-origin, not no-referrer:
# Django's CSRF check on the API reads Origin/Referer.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.houseplant-md.com wss://api.houseplant-md.com https://*.ingest.sentry.io https://*.ingest.us.sentry.io https://fcm.googleapis.com; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://www.youtube.com https://player.vimeo.com; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://api.houseplant-md.com https://accounts.google.com; frame-ancestors 'self' https://api.houseplant-md.com
